{
  "_id": "index-till",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "people of Lehi1 begin to till earth in promised land, 1 Ne. 18:24. Adam and Eve driven out of garden of Eden, to till earth, 2 Ne. 2:19 (Alma 42:2). Nephites till land, Enos 1:21 (Mosiah 6:7). Nephites make tools to till, Jarom 1:8. Mosiah2 tilled earth to avoid burdening his people, Mosiah 6:7. Zeniff’s people begin to till ground, Mosiah 9:9 (10:4). Jaredites begin to till earth in promised land, Ether 6:13. Jaredites make tools to till earth, Ether 10:25.",
